 "is_vocab": false,
 "stimulus_html": "For each sequence, determine if the sequence is a geometric sequence. If so, identify the common ratio.",
 "questions": [
  {
   "id": 506145,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"\\left\\{ { - 1, - 5, - 25, - 125, - 625, - 3125,,...} \\right\\}\">*</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Try 5.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"–1 \\times 5 = –5\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"–5 \\times 5 = –25\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"–25 \\times 5 = –125\"></span></p>\n<p>The pattern continues to work, so this is a geometric sequence. The common ratio is 5.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "It is a geometric sequence; common ratio is 5."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 506146,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"\\left\\{ { - 3,6, - 12,24,11,33} \\right\\}\">\\left\\{ { - 03,6, - 12,24,11,33} \\right\\}</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Try –2.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"–3 \\times –2 = 6\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"6 \\times –2 = –12\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"–12 \\times –2 = 24\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"24 \\times –2 = –48\"></span>, which is not the next term. This is not a geometric sequence.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "It is not a common ratio; term 2 is the first term multiplied by −2, but the sixth term is the fifth term multiplied by 3."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  },
  {
   "id": 506147,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<span data-math=\"\\left\\{ { - 500,50, - 5,\\frac{1}{2}, - \\frac{1}{{20}},...} \\right\\}\">\\left\\{ { - 500,50, - 5,\\frac{1}{2}, - \\frac{1}{{20}},...} \\right\\}</span>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
   "formats": [
    "free-response"
   ],
   "combo_choices": [],
   "collaborator_solutions": [
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "summary",
     "content_html": "<p>Try –0.1.</p>\n<p><span data-math=\"–500 \\times –0.1 = 50\"></span></p>\n<p><span data-math=\"50 \\times –0.1 = –5\"></span></p>\n<p>The pattern continues to work. This is a geometric sequence. The common ratio is –0.1 or <span data-math=\" - \\frac{1}{{10}}\"></span>.</p>"
    },
    {
     "images": [],
     "solution_type": "detailed",
     "content_html": "It is a geometric sequence; common ratio is <span data-math=\"- \\frac{1}{{10}}\">- \\frac{1}{{10}}</span>."
    }
   ],
   "community_solutions": []
  }
 ],
